OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and fine day ahead with
OL,6,Flengthy sunny periods. Sunshine may
OL,7,Fturn hazy at times throughout the day.
OL,8,FFeeling pleasantly warm in the
OL,9,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with clear skies to start
OL,12,Fthe night, however cloud will increase
OL,13,Ffrom the south after midnight, with a
OL,14,Frisk of patchy rain by dawn.
OL,15,FSoutheasterly winds increasing
OL,16,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
